---
import { androidObtainiumUrl, androidReleasesUrl } from '../../../shared/androidDistribution'
import Icon from './Icon.astro'
---

<div class="android-download card">
  <div class="android-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">Native Android app · Android 8+</p>
    <h2>Your vault, kept up to date.</h2>
    <p class="intro">Passwords, authenticator codes, and Autofill. Install with Obtainium to get new Authier releases directly from GitHub.</p>
    <a class="button" href={androidObtainiumUrl}>Set up with Obtainium <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>
    <a class="manual" href={androidReleasesUrl}>Download an APK manually</a>
  </div>
  <div class="android-setup">
    <ol>
      <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Install Obtainium</h3><p>The setup link helps you get Obtainium if you don’t have it yet. Then open the link again.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Add Authier and install</h3><p>Confirm the ready-to-use configuration, then install Authier from Obtainium. Allow installation when Android asks.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Keep background updates on</h3><p>Obtainium checks for new releases. On Android 12+, eligible updates install automatically. Older devices show an update notification.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="existing"><strong>Already using Authier?</strong> Install or update it in place through Obtainium so it can handle future updates. Keep your existing app installed to preserve your local vault.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .android-download { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: clamp(30px, 5vw, 72px); padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 52px); border-color: rgba(105, 230, 204, 0.25); background: linear-gradient(130deg, rgba(105, 230, 204, 0.06), transparent 65%); }
  h2 { margin: 0; max-width: 440px; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.05em; }
  .intro { max-width: 430px; color: var(--text-muted); margin: 24px 0 28px; line-height: 1.75; }
  .manual { display: block; margin-top: 18px; color: var(--text-subtle); font-size: 0.85rem; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  ol { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 24px; }
  li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr; gap: 14px; }
  li > span { color: var(--accent); font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; padding-top: 4px; }
  h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1rem; }
  li p, .existing { margin: 0; color: var(--text-subtle); font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .existing { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 22px; margin-top: 26px; }
  .existing strong { color: var(--text-muted); }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .android-download { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
